***Input***: German Interior Ministry Claims Progress on Crime 
 Interior Minister Wolfgang Schäuble released his department 's official statistics concerning crime in 2006 in Berlin on Tuesday . And the news was good -- most of the numbers were down compared to the preceding year . 
